{"seq":1,"slug":"pact-framework","title":"Pact 框架深入实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/tools/pact-framework","wordCount":1222,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"pact-框架深入实践\">Pact 框架深入实践</h1><h2 id=\"pact-的核心架构\">Pact 的核心架构</h2><p>Pact 是消费者驱动契约测试领域最成熟、社区最活跃的开源框架。它由 REA Group（澳大利亚房产平台）在 2013 年创建，经过十余年发展已成为事实标准，被 Atlassian、Canva、IBM、SEEK 等公司在生产环境中广泛使用。</p>\n<p>Pact 的核心架构由四个组件构成：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 消费者侧&#10;        CL[客户端代码] --&gt; PT[Pact 测试]&#10;        PT --&gt; MS[Mock Server]&#10;        MS --&gt; PF[Pact 文件 JSON]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 共享层&#10;        PF --&gt; PB[Pact Broker / PactFlow]&#10;        PB --&gt; VR[验证结果]&#10;        PB --&gt; CID[can-i-deploy]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 提供者侧&#10;        PB --&gt; PV[Provider Verifier]&#10;        PV --&gt; RP[真实 Provider]&#10;        RP --&gt; PV&#10;        PV --&gt; VR&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 消费者侧\n        CL[客户端代码] --&gt; PT[Pact 测试]\n        PT --&gt; MS[Mock Server]\n        MS --&gt; PF[Pact 文件 JSON]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 共享层\n        PF --&gt; PB[Pact Broker / PactFlow]\n        PB --&gt; VR[验证结果]\n        PB --&gt; CID[can-i-deploy]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 提供者侧\n        PB --&gt; PV[Provider Verifier]\n        PV --&gt; RP[真实 Provider]\n        RP --&gt; PV\n        PV --&gt; VR\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>实现位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Mock Server</td>\n<td>模拟提供者响应消费者请求</td>\n<td>消费者 CI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pact File</td>\n<td>JSON 格式的契约产物</td>\n<td>文件系统 / Broker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Provider Verifier</td>\n<td>回放契约请求验证提供者</td>\n<td>提供者 CI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pact Broker</td>\n<td>契约的存储、版本管理和协作中枢</td>\n<td>独立部署的服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Pact 的核心概念包括：<strong>Interaction</strong>——一组请求/响应对的描述；<strong>Matcher</strong>——类型、格式和结构的约束规则（区别于固定值）；<strong>Provider State</strong>——提供者验证前的数据准备条件；<strong>Pact File</strong>——JSON 格式的契约产物文件；<strong>Verifier</strong>——提供者侧回放契约并比对结果的组件。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Interaction 是契约的最小粒度单位，每个 Interaction 描述一次独立的服务间交互</li>\n<li>Matcher 让契约验证结构而非具体数据值，赋予提供者实现的灵活性</li>\n<li>Provider State 是连接契约与提供者测试数据的桥梁</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"pact-规范版本演进\">Pact 规范版本演进</h2><p>Pact 规范定义了契约文件的 JSON 格式和交互语义，经历了多次演进：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规范版本</th>\n<th>核心能力</th>\n<th>发布时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>V1</td>\n<td>基础 HTTP 交互</td>\n<td>2013</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V2</td>\n<td>正则匹配器、Provider State</td>\n<td>2015</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V3</td>\n<td>多 Provider State、Generator</td>\n<td>2017</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V4</td>\n<td>同步/异步消息统一、插件系统、Request/Response + Message 混合</td>\n<td>2021</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>V4 规范是当前推荐使用的版本，它将 HTTP 交互和消息交互统一到同一个契约文件中，并引入了 Plugin Framework 支持自定义协议（gRPC、GraphQL 等）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"消费者端实现详解\">消费者端实现详解</h2><h3 id=\"安装与配置\">安装与配置</h3><p>以 Node.js 生态为例（pact-js 是最活跃的语言实现之一）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { PactV4, MatchersV3 } from &#39;@pact-foundation/pact&#39;;&#10;&#10;const { like, regex, eachLike, integer, string, iso8601 } = MatchersV3;&#10;&#10;const provider = new PactV4({&#10;  consumer: &#39;OrderService&#39;,&#10;  provider: &#39;UserService&#39;,&#10;  dir: &#39;./pacts&#39;,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { PactV4, MatchersV3 } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@pact-foundation/pact'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">like</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">regex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">eachLike</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">iso8601</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MatchersV3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> provider</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PactV4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  consumer: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'OrderService'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  provider: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UserService'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dir: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./pacts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"matcher-系统\">Matcher 系统</h3><p>Matcher 是 Pact 的精髓——它让契约验证的是<strong>结构和类型约束</strong>而非固定值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Matcher</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>like(value)</code></td>\n<td>匹配相同类型的任意值</td>\n<td><code>like(42)</code> → 任意整数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>string(example)</code></td>\n<td>匹配任意字符串</td>\n<td><code>string(&#39;hello&#39;)</code> → 任意非空字符串</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>integer(example)</code></td>\n<td>匹配任意整数</td>\n<td><code>integer(1)</code> → 任意整数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>regex(pattern, example)</code></td>\n<td>匹配正则表达式</td>\n<td><code>regex(&#39;^\\\\d{4}$&#39;, &#39;2026&#39;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>iso8601()</code></td>\n<td>匹配 ISO 8601 时间格式</td>\n<td>任意合法 datetime</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>eachLike(example)</code></td>\n<td>数组中每个元素匹配类型</td>\n<td><code>eachLike({id: like(1)})</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>atLeastOneLike(example, min)</code></td>\n<td>至少 N 个匹配元素</td>\n<td>确保数组非空</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"完整消费者测试示例\">完整消费者测试示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"describe(&#39;OrderService -&gt; UserService contract&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  it(&#39;returns user details when user exists&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;    await provider&#10;      .addInteraction()&#10;      .given(&#39;user abc-123 exists&#39;)&#10;      .uponReceiving(&#39;a request for user abc-123&#39;)&#10;      .withRequest(&#39;GET&#39;, &#39;/users/abc-123&#39;, (builder) =&gt; {&#10;        builder.headers({ Authorization: like(&#39;Bearer token&#39;) });&#10;      })&#10;      .willRespondWith(200, (builder) =&gt; {&#10;        builder.headers({ &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/json&#39; }).jsonBody({&#10;          id: string(&#39;abc-123&#39;),&#10;          name: string(&#39;Alice&#39;),&#10;          email: regex(/^.+@.+\\..+$/, &#39;alice@example.com&#39;),&#10;          plan: string(&#39;pro&#39;),&#10;          createdAt: iso8601(),&#10;        });&#10;      })&#10;      .executeTest(async (mockServer) =&gt; {&#10;        const client = new UserClient(mockServer.url);&#10;        const user = await client.getUser(&#39;abc-123&#39;);&#10;&#10;        expect(user.id).toBeDefined();&#10;        expect(user.email).toContain(&#39;@&#39;);&#10;      });&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'OrderService -> UserService contract'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'returns user details when user exists'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> provider</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addInteraction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user abc-123 exists'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">uponReceiving</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'a request for user abc-123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GET'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/users/abc-123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">builder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        builder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ Authorization: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">like</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Bearer token'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">willRespondWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">builder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        builder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Content-Type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application/json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jsonBody</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          id: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'abc-123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          name: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          email: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">regex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">@</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'alice@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          plan: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pro'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          createdAt: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">iso8601</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">executeTest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mockServer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> client</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mockServer.url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'abc-123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user.id).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeDefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user.email).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toContain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"提供者端验证详解\">提供者端验证详解</h2><p>提供者验证是 Pact 工作流的另一半——它确保真实实现满足消费者的期望。</p>\n<h3 id=\"验证配置\">验证配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Verifier } from &#39;@pact-foundation/pact&#39;;&#10;&#10;const verifier = new Verifier({&#10;  providerBaseUrl: &#39;http://localhost:3000&#39;,&#10;  provider: &#39;UserService&#39;,&#10;  pactBrokerUrl: &#39;https://broker.example.com&#39;,&#10;  pactBrokerToken: process.env.PACT_BROKER_TOKEN,&#10;  publishVerificationResult: true,&#10;  providerVersion: process.env.GIT_SHA,&#10;  providerVersionBranch: process.env.GIT_BRANCH,&#10;  consumerVersionSelectors: [{ mainBranch: true }, { deployedOrReleased: true }],&#10;  stateHandlers: {&#10;    &#39;user abc-123 exists&#39;: async () =&gt; {&#10;      await seedDatabase({ id: &#39;abc-123&#39;, name: &#39;Alice&#39; });&#10;    },&#10;    &#39;no users exist&#39;: async () =&gt; {&#10;      await clearDatabase();&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;await verifier.verifyProvider();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Verifier } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@pact-foundation/pact'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> verifier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Verifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  providerBaseUrl: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://localhost:3000'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  provider: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UserService'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pactBrokerUrl: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://broker.example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pactBrokerToken: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">PACT_BROKER_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  publishVerificationResult: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  providerVersion: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">GIT_SHA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  providerVersionBranch: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">GIT_BRANCH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  consumerVersionSelectors: [{ mainBranch: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, { deployedOrReleased: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stateHandlers: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'user abc-123 exists'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> seedDatabase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ id: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'abc-123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'no users exist'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> clearDatabase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> verifier.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">verifyProvider</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"consumer-version-selectors\">Consumer Version Selectors</h3><p>选择验证哪些消费者版本的契约是一个重要决策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Selector</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>{ mainBranch: true }</code></td>\n<td>消费者主分支最新版</td>\n<td>确保与消费者最新代码兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{ deployedOrReleased: true }</code></td>\n<td>当前已部署/发布的版本</td>\n<td>确保与生产环境兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{ branch: &#39;feature-x&#39; }</code></td>\n<td>特定分支最新版</td>\n<td>联调阶段验证特性分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{ tag: &#39;prod&#39; }</code></td>\n<td>带特定标签的版本</td>\n<td>兼容旧版标签管理方式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推荐组合：<code>[{ mainBranch: true }, { deployedOrReleased: true }]</code>——同时保证与最新开发和当前生产环境兼容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pact-的多语言生态\">Pact 的多语言生态</h2><p>Pact 通过 Rust Core（pact-reference）提供跨语言的统一底层实现，各语言 SDK 通过 FFI 绑定调用核心逻辑：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    RC[Pact Rust Core&lt;br/&gt;pact-reference] --&gt; FFI[FFI Layer]&#10;    FFI --&gt; JS[pact-js&lt;br/&gt;Node.js/TypeScript]&#10;    FFI --&gt; JVM[pact-jvm&lt;br/&gt;Java/Kotlin/Groovy]&#10;    FFI --&gt; GO[pact-go&lt;br/&gt;Go]&#10;    FFI --&gt; PY[pact-python&lt;br/&gt;Python]&#10;    FFI --&gt; NET[pact-net&lt;br/&gt;.NET/C#]&#10;    FFI --&gt; RUBY[pact-ruby&lt;br/&gt;Ruby]&#10;    FFI --&gt; SWIFT[pact-swift&lt;br/&gt;iOS/macOS]&#10;    FFI --&gt; PHP[pact-php&lt;br/&gt;PHP]\">flowchart TB\n    RC[Pact Rust Core&lt;br/&gt;pact-reference] --&gt; FFI[FFI Layer]\n    FFI --&gt; JS[pact-js&lt;br/&gt;Node.js/TypeScript]\n    FFI --&gt; JVM[pact-jvm&lt;br/&gt;Java/Kotlin/Groovy]\n    FFI --&gt; GO[pact-go&lt;br/&gt;Go]\n    FFI --&gt; PY[pact-python&lt;br/&gt;Python]\n    FFI --&gt; NET[pact-net&lt;br/&gt;.NET/C#]\n    FFI --&gt; RUBY[pact-ruby&lt;br/&gt;Ruby]\n    FFI --&gt; SWIFT[pact-swift&lt;br/&gt;iOS/macOS]\n    FFI --&gt; PHP[pact-php&lt;br/&gt;PHP]</pre><p>这种架构确保了所有语言实现对 Pact 规范（特别是 V4）的一致支持，避免了各语言实现之间的功能差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见陷阱与最佳实践\">常见陷阱与最佳实践</h2><p><strong>陷阱 1：过度精确的契约</strong>。在响应体中使用精确值匹配而非类型匹配，导致提供者端测试脆弱——数据库种子数据的微小变化就会破坏验证。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱 2：遗漏错误场景</strong>。只测试 Happy Path（200 响应），忽略 404、400、500 等错误响应的契约，导致消费者的错误处理逻辑从未被契约保护。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱 3：将 Pact 测试当做功能测试</strong>。在消费者测试中放入大量业务断言，模糊了契约测试（验证接口结构）与功能测试（验证业务逻辑）的边界。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱 4：Provider State 过于复杂</strong>。把 state handler 写成完整的端到端数据准备流程，导致验证测试脆弱且缓慢。State handler 应该尽量简单——直接向数据库插入最小必要数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Pact 是消费者驱动契约测试的事实标准框架，其 Rust Core + FFI 架构确保了跨语言一致性，V4 规范统一了 HTTP 和消息交互。掌握 Matcher 的正确使用（结构匹配而非精确值）、Provider State 的轻量设计、以及 Consumer Version Selector 的合理组合，是 Pact 实践成功的关键。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>延伸阅读</strong>：下一篇 <a href=\"spring-cloud-contract\">Spring Cloud Contract</a> 将介绍 JVM 生态的原生契约测试方案。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Pact 框架深入实践","id":"pact-框架深入实践"},{"level":2,"text":"Pact 的核心架构","id":"pact-的核心架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Pact 规范版本演进","id":"pact-规范版本演进"},{"level":2,"text":"消费者端实现详解","id":"消费者端实现详解"},{"level":3,"text":"安装与配置","id":"安装与配置"},{"level":3,"text":"Matcher 系统","id":"matcher-系统"},{"level":3,"text":"完整消费者测试示例","id":"完整消费者测试示例"},{"level":2,"text":"提供者端验证详解","id":"提供者端验证详解"},{"level":3,"text":"验证配置","id":"验证配置"},{"level":3,"text":"Consumer Version Selectors","id":"consumer-version-selectors"},{"level":2,"text":"Pact 的多语言生态","id":"pact-的多语言生态"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱与最佳实践","id":"常见陷阱与最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"契约类型与选型策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/foundations/contract-types"},"next":{"title":"Spring Cloud Contract 实践指南","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/tools/spring-cloud-contract"}}